<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37646" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">prae-grandis</span></b> , e, adj.,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>very
			large</i>, <i>huge</i>, <i>colossal</i>
			(ante-class. and post-Aug.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">praegrandi gradu, Pac. ap. Fest. s. v.
					torvitas, p. 355 Müll. (Trag. Rel. p. 67 Rib.):
					arbores,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					13, 25, 49, § 138</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aures,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 4,
					13, 27, § 95</span></i>
			; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">oculi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 8,
					33, 51, § 121</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">boves,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 8,
					45, 70, § 176</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">domus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 3,
					16, 20, § 119</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fel,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					11, 37, 74, § 191</span></i>
			: locusta,
			
			<i><span class="en">Suet. Tib. 60</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lapides,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg.
					Ezech. 13, 11</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>very great</i>, <i>powerful</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">praegrandis senex,</span>”
				i. e. <i>the great Aristophanes</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Pers.
					1, 124</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
